---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { buildPageSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy' },
];

const schema = buildPageSchema({
  name: 'Privacy Policy',
  description: 'How Paw & Sage handles personal data, email subscriptions, analytics, and affiliate tracking.',
  path: '/privacy',
  about: 'Privacy practices, analytics, newsletter subscriptions, and affiliate cookies',
});
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How paw and sage handles your data." breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} schema={[schema]}>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container-narrow prose">
      <p class="lede">
        We collect as little data as we can, and we don't share what we collect.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Email addresses</strong> - only when you voluntarily sign up for our newsletter or
        download a free resource. We use these to send you the content you requested and occasional
        updates.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Anonymous analytics</strong> - we use Vercel Web Analytics, a privacy-respecting
        analytics tool that does not use cookies and does not collect personally identifiable
        information. It counts page views in aggregate and does not track you across websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Umami Cloud analytics</strong> - we also use Umami Cloud, provided by Umami Software,
        Inc. (United States), to understand in aggregate which pages are read and which outbound
        product links and newsletter forms are used. Umami is cookieless, does not collect personal
        data such as names or email addresses, does not store full IP addresses, and does not track you
        across websites. Events such as "affiliate link clicked" or "newsletter form submitted" are
        recorded only as anonymous counts with the page and link they relate to. The legal basis is our
        legitimate interest in understanding and improving the site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). See
        <a href="https://umami.is/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Umami's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> - we use Google Analytics 4, provided by Google Ireland
        Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland (for users outside the EEA: Google LLC,
        USA), to understand how visitors use the site in aggregate (pages viewed, approximate region,
        device type, referring sites). Google Analytics may use cookies and similar technologies. For
        visitors from the EEA, the UK and Switzerland, analytics cookies are disabled by default via
        Google Consent Mode, so only cookieless, aggregated measurement is sent. Advertising features,
        remarketing and ad personalization are turned off. IP addresses are not logged or stored by
        Google Analytics 4. Data may be transferred to the United States; Google is certified under the
        EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in understanding and
        improving the site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) and, where cookies are used, your consent (Art. 6(1)(a)
        GDPR, Section 25 TDDDG). You can opt out with the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
        See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Affiliate cookies</strong> - when you click an affiliate link to Amazon, Amazon may
        place tracking cookies on your device. This is governed by Amazon's privacy policy, not
        ours.
      </p>
      <p>
        The same applies to links that run through other affiliate networks such as Impact, Awin and
        Skimlinks (Sovrn). When you click such a link, the network and the retailer may set cookies or
        use similar technologies to attribute a purchase to this site. This is governed by their
        respective privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell your data to anyone, ever.</li>
        <li>We do not run third-party advertising.</li>
        <li>We do not use Facebook or advertising tracking pixels, and we do not use Google Analytics for advertising or remarketing.</li>
        <li>We do not require account creation to read the site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Newsletter and email service</h2>
      <p>
        If you sign up for our newsletter or the free indoor cat enrichment checklist, we process your
        email address to send you the checklist, seasonal guides, product picks and occasional updates.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Provider:</strong> our newsletter is sent with MailerLite, operated by MailerLite Limited,
        88 Harcourt Street, Dublin 2, D02 DK18, Ireland (EU). MailerLite stores and processes your email
        address on our behalf under a data processing agreement. See
        <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MailerLite's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Double opt-in:</strong> after you submit the form, you receive a confirmation email. You
        are only added to the list after you click the confirmation link. We record the time of sign-up
        and confirmation to document your consent.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Legal basis:</strong> your consent under Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR. You can withdraw your consent
        at any time with effect for the future.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Unsubscribing:</strong> every email contains an unsubscribe link. You can also email
        <a href="mailto:hello@pawandsage.com">hello@pawandsage.com</a>. After you unsubscribe, we delete
        your email address from the active list, unless we need to keep a record to document your
        earlier consent or to honor your opt-out.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under GDPR (and similar regulations), you have the right to access, correct, or delete any
        personal data we hold about you. Email <a href="mailto:hello@pawandsage.com">hello@pawandsage.com</a>
        with any request.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header { padding: 3rem 0 2rem; text-align: center; }
  .page-header .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .content-section { padding: 2rem 0 5rem; }
  .prose { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .lede {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .updated {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
